OL,3,GNEWSAResidents feel 'let down' in
OL,4,Atroubled road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fatal fire, in which a man in his 60s
OL,7,Fwas killed, is the latest terrible
OL,8,Fincident on a now notorious road in
OL,9,FGreater Manchester where residents feel
OL,10,Fforgotten by the authorities supposed
OL,11,Fto look out for them.
OL,13,FBaguley Crescent is a small estate off
OL,14,Fthe M60, between Prestwich and
OL,15,FMiddleton, which has been blighted by
OL,16,Ffly-tipping, a condemned building and
OL,17,Fanti-social behaviour.
