OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAResidents feel 'let down' in
OL,4,Atroubled road
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal MPs have claimed police have been
OL,7,Fto afraid for their safety to patrol
OL,8,Fthe road, and despite years of
OL,9,Fcomplaints the area has seen little
OL,10,Fimprovement.
OL,12,FI have been reporting on conditions at
OL,13,FBaguley Crescent for years, but what I
OL,14,Fsaw when speaking to some social
OL,15,Fhousing tenants about the recent fatal
OL,16,Ffire shocked me.
